    "description": "The gods launch the \"Sealing God Plan\" to end the Shang Dynasty, dispatching the Nine-Tailed Fox in the form of Daji to corrupt King Zhou. Defying heaven, King Zhou challenges the gods from his Plucking Stars Tower, obsessed with power and immortality. Blinded by his infatuation for Daji and manipulated by Shen Gongbao, he slaughters loyal ministers like Bian Gan, plunging the people into misery. As chaos reigns, the sage Jiang Ziya rallies the lords to besiege the capital, Chaoge. Here, King Zhou and his demon consort make their final stand, igniting a monumental war that engulfs the realms of mortals, gods, and demons.",
